64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"62"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-03T09:27:48-07:00","id":613491,"title":"","content":"Just found this. I actually ran a Pre-GMC princess as an NPC in a NWoD crossover game set in Chicago for my gaming group. She wasn't a shrinking violet as she had some neat Archery skills (From WoD: Armory). I would like to give this a shot.<br /> <br /> A few points:<br /> <br /> I will most likely take the role of a Prince instead of a Princess. I trust this will not be an issue, but if it is I will graciously go with the other option.<br /> I may very well go Gothic. I mean, classic Bram Stoker, Mary Shelly Gothic. Not newer Gothic Punk stuff.<br /> <br /> Let me know what you think and I will look at the Post-GMC rules when I get a chance.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyx